From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:22:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 290/297] Unified: the bar for a part of the assembly; closing
 the last 3D view closes the file; files open on their 3D view

- A face of a part put into the assembly from another file gets the
  assembly's tools (snap, one more, grid, measure, hide), not the part's
  own (which would change the other file). Picks in an assembly being
  edited are picks in the view.
- After the save question of the last 3D view, the file without views is
  closed; Cancel keeps it.
- The drawing's center lines are looked at again once its views have
  their new lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
